// Hand-written; goqtgen never overwrites *_manual.go files.

// Package qtcore binds QtCore: QObject, models, timers, files, QVariant and
// the geometry value types. It is generated by cmd/goqtgen from spec/.
//
// Every wrapped object has one Go handle that knows who owns it (Owned,
// Parented, Borrowed or Dead) and learns when Qt destroys it, so a use after
// free panics with a message instead of crashing. Each method's doc comment
// gives its C++ signature, ownership rule and a link to the Qt docs.
package qtcore

//go:generate go run ../cmd/goqtgen -root ..
